8:13. The midrashic conclusion that the dead converse with one another is found in Bereshit Rabbah 100:2 and Sotah 34b.", :sources ["Genesis 12:4" "Genesis 28:10" "Genesis 12:7" "Genesis 26:3" "Genesis 28:13" "Bereshit Rabbah 100:2" "Sotah 34b"]}}], :arithmetic [{:kind :rashei-tevot, :phrase "ב\"ג המלך", :spells "בשני או ג'", :letters ["ב" "ה"], :by :selah, :order :mismatch} {:kind :rashei-tevot, :phrase "שבת תשובה וילך", :spells "שבת תשובה וילך", :letters ["ש" "ת" "ו"], :by :selah, :order :mismatch} {:kind :other, :note "Gezera shava: the word וילך links Moses going to the Patriarchs going", :by :selah, :ran? false}], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :discipline "bht-chalkboard-v1", :timestamp "2026-07-12T23:40:38.659505968Z", :model "glm-5.2"}